<title>SWEDEN: SOM and Swedish OM increase cooperation.</title>
<headline>SOM and Swedish OM increase cooperation.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish futures and options exchange OM said on Monday it would increase its cooperation with Finnish bourse and clearing organisation Suomen Optiomeklarit Oy (SOM) to include a Helibor-FRA contract.</p>
<p>Helibor, or Helsinki Interbank Offered Rates, would be included from September 17, OM said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;As previously, the cooperation with SOM includes that no new membership agreements need to be signed,&quot; OM said.</p>
<p>It added that existing account structures could be used.</p>
<p>A new Helibor-FRA contract with a 21 month-maturity would be listed every third month, OM said.</p>
